      "comment": "⚠️ plural: \"1 min read\" / \"{N} min read\". `{N}` = ⌈wordCount ÷ WPM⌉. Use a single documented constant **WPM = 220** for MVP. Word count is derived from the **article's** content language, not the UI language. fr-CA/pt-BR: \"min\" is already an invariant abbreviation in both languages, no plural variant needed.",
